<?php row('Exact production admin_db_backup.php v1.5 baseline',$baselineOk,$currentHash); ?>
<?php row('Complete v1.6 replacement embedded',$replacementOk,NEW_SHA256); ?>
</table></div>
<?php if($preflightOk): ?><div class="card"><h2>What changes</h2><ul>
<li>Rename uses the same radio-selected file as Restore.</li>
<li>Selecting a radio auto-fills Rename with the current filename minus <code>.sql</code>.</li>
